{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't Sleep plunges players into a heart-pounding horror experience set in a dark and foreboding bedroom infested with malevolent monsters. As night falls, players must navigate the eerie environment, using cunning and strategy to outwit the lurking creatures and survive until dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Suspenseful Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in an atmospheric and suspenseful gameplay experience that will test your nerves and keep you guessing as you navigate the nightmarish bedroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491070/extras/Room_V02.gif?t=1741914992\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize cunning and decision-making skills to outsmart the creatures that lurk in the shadows, ensuring your survival through the long night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491070/extras/Hiding.gif?t=1741914992\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Terrifying Monster Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against a variety of bone-chilling monsters that lurk in the shadows, each with its own unique abilities and behaviors that will keep you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491070/extras/Monster.gif?t=1741914992\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3491070?t=1741914992","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3491070?t=1741914992","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491070/19c21e3e8493d75a9191e521df5a639e352db078/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=17